page Tip Splitter

type Split {bill:number, tip:number, people:number}

state bill=0
state tip=15
state people=1

card "Tip Splitter" sm center
  form
    input bill kind=number aria="Bill total" placeholder="Total bill" required
    input tip kind=number aria="Tip percentage" placeholder="Tip percentage" required
    input people kind=number min=1 aria="Number of people" placeholder="Number of people" required
  row between
    metric {bill} label="Bill total"
    metric {(bill * tip / 100)} label="Tip amount"
    metric {(bill + bill * tip / 100)} label="Total with tip"
    metric {((bill + bill * tip / 100) / people)} label="Amount per person"

This GUML code creates a simple tip splitter with fields for the bill total, tip percentage, and number of people. It calculates and displays the tip amount, total with tip, and amount each person owes. The calculations are done client-side, without any API calls.
